# Text files are LF in every checkout (gofmt, migration checksums and the
# embedded installer scripts must be byte-identical on Windows and Linux).
* text=auto eol=lf
# Migration checksums must be identical across Windows and Linux checkouts.
*.sql text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.lock text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf

